<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #4f46e5;
            --secondary: #2563eb;
            --accent: #f59e0b;
            --text-main: #1e293b;
            --text-light: #475569;
            --bg-light: #f8fafc;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .letter-container {
            background-color: white;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 850px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        /* Top Accent Bar */
        .accent-bar {
            height: 8px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary), #8b5cf6, var(--accent));
            width: 100%;
        }

        .header-section {
            padding: 30px 40px 20px 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-light) 0%, white 100%);
        }

        .brand-logos {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .mt-logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .mt-logo img {
            height: 45px;
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 6px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        
        .mt-logo-text {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .mt-logo-text h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e293b;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .omni-branding {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary);
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .school-logo-container {
            text-align: right;
            max-width: 250px;
        }

        .school-logo {
            max-height: 80px;
            max-width: 180px;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .school-name-header {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            margin: 10px 0 0 0;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--secondary);
        }

        .content-section {
            padding: 30px 50px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .date-text {
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        .salutation {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 22px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .highlight-box {
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .signature-section {
            margin-top: 30px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .signature-details h4 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            margin: 0 0 5px 0;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .signature-details p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .footer-section {
            background-color: var(--text-main);
            color: white;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        
        .footer-section a {
            color: #93c5fd;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Decorative Elements */
        .decor-circle-1 {
            position: absolute;
            top: -50px;
            right: -50px;
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(79,70,229,0.1) 0%, rgba(79,70,229,0) 70%);
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .content-relative {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background: white;
                padding: 0;
            }
            .letter-container {
                box-shadow: none;
                max-width: 100%;
                border-radius: 0;
            }
            .no-print {
                display: none !important;
            }
        }
        
        .btn-print {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
            z-index: 999;
        }
        
        .btn-print:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        <% if (typeof isPdf !== 'undefined' && isPdf) { %>
        body {
            padding: 0 !important;
            background: white !important;
        }
        .letter-container {
            box-shadow: none !important;
            max-width: 100% !important;
            border-radius: 0 !important;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .content-relative {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .content-section {
            flex: 1;
        }
        .footer-section {
            margin-top: auto;
        }
        <% } %>
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <% if (typeof isPdf === 'undefined' || !isPdf) { %>
    <a class="btn-print no-print" style="text-decoration: none; color: white; display: flex; align-items: center;" href="/admin/crm/leads/<%= lead.id %>/thanks-letter/pdf">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="margin-right: 8px;">
            <path d="M2.5 8a.5.5 0 1 0 0-1 .5.5 0 0 0 0 1z"/>
            <path d="M5 1a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2H2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h1v1a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h6a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1h1a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1V3a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5zM4 3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h6a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v2H4V3zm1 5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v1H2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5zm7 2v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h6a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/>
        </svg>
        Download Official PDF
    </a>
    <% } %>

    <div class="letter-container">
        <div class="accent-bar"></div>
        <div class="decor-circle-1"></div>
        
        <div class="content-relative">
            <div class="header-section">
                <div class="brand-logos">
                    <div class="mt-logo">
                        <img src="https://muhaimintech.com/Frame121.png" alt="Muhaimin Technologies" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
                        <div class="mt-logo-text">
                            <h1>Muhaimin Tech.</h1>
                            <div class="omni-branding">Omni School Powered</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="school-logo-container">
                    <% if (tenant && tenant.logo_url) { %>
                        <img src="<%= tenant.logo_url %>" alt="School Logo" class="school-logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
                    <% } %>
                    <h2 class="school-name-header"><%= lead.school_name %></h2>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="content-section">
                <div class="date-text">
                    <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { weekday: 'long', year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %>
                </div>

                <div class="salutation">
                    Dear <%= lead.contact_person || 'Esteemed Partner' %>,
                </div>

                <p>
                    On behalf of the entire team at <strong>Muhaimin Technologies</strong>, it is my absolute pleasure to officially welcome <strong><%= lead.school_name %></strong> to the Omni School family. 
                </p>

                <p>
                    We recognize that choosing a technological partner to manage and streamline your educational institution is a significant decision. We are deeply honored by the trust you have placed in our <strong>Omni School ERP</strong> platform. Our mission has always been to empower educators, and we are thrilled to bring that vision to your campus.
                </p>

                <div class="highlight-box">
                    "Technology will never replace great teachers, but technology in the hands of great teachers is transformational." 
                    <br><span style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 400;">— George Couros</span>
                </div>

                <p>
                    Our platform is built to optimize your day-to-day operations, giving you more time to focus on what truly matters: student success. We are committed to ensuring a seamless transition and a brilliant start to this new chapter.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Should you or your team have any immediate questions, our support desk is at your full disposal. 
                </p>

                <p>
                    Thank you once again for choosing Muhaimin Technologies. Here is to a future of innovation, excellence, and shared success!
                </p>

                <div class="signature-section">
                    <div style="width: 80px; height: 3px; background-color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 15px;"></div>
                    <div class="signature-details">
                        <h4>Khurram Shahzad</h4>
                        <p>Chief Technology Officer</p>
                        <p>Muhaimin Technologies</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-section">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                    <img src="<%= typeof omniLogo !== 'undefined' ? omniLogo : '/images/omnischool_logo.png' %>" alt="OmniSchool" style="height: 30px;" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
                    <span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;">Omni School</span>
                </div>
                <strong>Muhaimin Technologies</strong> | Empowering Education Through Innovation<br>
                <div style="margin-top: 10px; color: #94a3b8;">
                    Visit us at <a href="https://muhaimintech.com" target="_blank">www.muhaimintech.com</a> | support@muhaimintech.com
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
